<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TEJ renews cautionary on negotiations.</title>
<headline>TEJ renews cautionary on negotiations.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Towles, Edgar Jacobs Ltd on Thursday renewed a previous cautionary dated May 8 saying it was in still talks which could have an impact on its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>No further details were given in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
